{"lines": [{"text": "The ticket says eighty dollars, so why does checkout say about one hundred?", "start": 0.6, "end": 4.728, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.159], ["ticket", 0.17, 0.477], ["says", 0.489, 0.898], ["eighty", 1.068, 1.273], ["dollars", 1.273, 1.773], ["so", 1.966, 2.114], ["why", 2.17, 2.307], ["does", 2.307, 2.42], ["checkout", 2.42, 2.773], ["say", 2.773, 3.023], ["about", 3.034, 3.261], ["one", 3.261, 3.398], ["hundred", 3.409, 3.795]]}, {"text": "Let's open the price tag.", "start": 4.978, "end": 6.85, "spec": null, "words": [["Let's", 0.091, 0.205], ["open", 0.205, 0.375], ["the", 0.375, 0.432], ["price", 0.432, 0.716], ["tag", 0.716, 1.057]]}, {"text": "First come the fees: a service fee, a facility fee, and an order fee, stacked on top.", "start": 7.1, "end": 13.124, "spec": null, "words": [["First", 0.125, 0.364], ["come", 0.364, 0.511], ["the", 0.511, 0.568], ["fees", 0.58, 1.136], ["a", 1.5, 1.545], ["service", 1.545, 1.943], ["fee", 1.943, 2.375], ["a", 2.545, 2.625], ["facility", 2.636, 3.125], ["fee", 3.136, 3.534], ["and", 3.795, 3.909], ["an", 3.92, 4.0], ["order", 4.011, 4.227], ["fee", 4.239, 4.625], ["stacked", 4.875, 5.205], ["on", 5.205, 5.318], ["top", 5.318, 5.67]]}, {"text": "On primary ticket sites, fees typically add roughly a quarter to the base price.", "start": 13.374, "end": 18.846, "spec": null, "words": [["On", 0.08, 0.182], ["primary", 0.182, 0.625], ["ticket", 0.625, 0.898], ["sites", 0.898, 1.386], ["fees", 1.727, 2.068], ["typically", 2.193, 2.614], ["add", 2.614, 2.966], ["roughly", 3.284, 3.636], ["a", 3.636, 3.705], ["quarter", 3.705, 4.159], ["to", 4.17, 4.261], ["the", 4.261, 4.341], ["base", 4.341, 4.568], ["price", 4.58, 5.148]]}, {"text": "Resale sites often charge even more, averaging roughly thirty percent in fees.", "start": 19.096, "end": 24.28, "spec": null, "words": [["Resale", 0.08, 0.5], ["sites", 0.5, 0.864], ["often", 0.977, 1.307], ["charge", 1.307, 1.693], ["even", 1.693, 1.92], ["more", 1.932, 2.273], ["averaging", 2.705, 3.114], ["roughly", 3.114, 3.489], ["thirty", 3.568, 3.852], ["percent", 3.852, 4.25], ["in", 4.25, 4.307], ["fees", 4.307, 4.852]]}, {"text": "But the biggest markup often happens before you even reach checkout.", "start": 24.53, "end": 28.202, "spec": null, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.17], ["the", 0.17, 0.25], ["biggest", 0.25, 0.67], ["markup", 0.682, 1.102], ["often", 1.216, 1.545], ["happens", 1.545, 1.909], ["before", 1.909, 2.25], ["you", 2.25, 2.341], ["even", 2.341, 2.614], ["reach", 2.614, 2.83], ["checkout", 2.83, 3.352]]}, {"text": "Artists often price tickets below what fans would pay, to keep shows affordable and sold out.", "start": 28.452, "end": 34.164, "spec": null, "words": [["Artists", 0.091, 0.42], ["often", 0.489, 0.864], ["price", 0.864, 1.227], ["tickets", 1.227, 1.523], ["below", 1.523, 2.045], ["what", 2.182, 2.33], ["fans", 2.341, 2.659], ["would", 2.659, 2.784], ["pay", 2.784, 3.17], ["to", 3.545, 3.625], ["keep", 3.636, 3.818], ["shows", 3.818, 4.057], ["affordable", 4.057, 4.727], ["and", 4.727, 4.784], ["sold", 4.784, 5.091], ["out", 5.091, 5.386]]}, {"text": "That gap is an open invitation for resellers.", "start": 34.414, "end": 37.366, "spec": null, "words": [["That", 0.091, 0.261], ["gap", 0.261, 0.591], ["is", 0.705, 0.795], ["an", 0.795, 0.909], ["open", 0.955, 1.17], ["invitation", 1.17, 1.716], ["for", 1.727, 1.898], ["resellers", 1.898, 2.602]]}, {"text": "Professional brokers use software bots to grab large blocks of tickets within seconds of release.", "start": 37.616, "end": 43.52, "spec": null, "words": [["Professional", 0.091, 0.511], ["brokers", 0.523, 0.943], ["use", 0.943, 1.091], ["software", 1.091, 1.636], ["bots", 1.636, 2.068], ["to", 2.261, 2.364], ["grab", 2.364, 2.761], ["large", 2.761, 3.17], ["blocks", 3.17, 3.511], ["of", 3.523, 3.614], ["tickets", 3.614, 4.102], ["within", 4.193, 4.489], ["seconds", 4.5, 4.943], ["of", 4.955, 5.011], ["release", 5.023, 5.568]]}, {"text": "Then they relist them, often at about double the face value.", "start": 43.77, "end": 47.25, "spec": null, "words": [["Then", 0.08, 0.148], ["they", 0.159, 0.25], ["relist", 0.25, 0.773], ["them", 0.773, 1.023], ["often", 1.295, 1.67], ["at", 1.67, 1.727], ["about", 1.739, 2.068], ["double", 2.08, 2.307], ["the", 2.307, 2.375], ["face", 2.375, 2.727], ["value", 2.727, 3.159]]}, {"text": "Some sellers also use dynamic pricing, so the price climbs with demand in real time.", "start": 47.5, "end": 52.372, "spec": null, "words": [["Some", 0.091, 0.261], ["sellers", 0.273, 0.727], ["also", 0.739, 1.034], ["use", 1.034, 1.318], ["dynamic", 1.33, 1.795], ["pricing", 1.807, 2.261], ["so", 2.591, 2.67], ["the", 2.67, 2.75], ["price", 2.761, 3.011], ["climbs", 3.011, 3.295], ["with", 3.295, 3.398], ["demand", 3.409, 3.852], ["in", 3.852, 3.977], ["real", 3.989, 4.205], ["time", 4.205, 4.545]]}, {"text": "So much of what you pay above face value goes to platforms and resellers, not the artist.", "start": 52.622, "end": 57.662, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.261], ["much", 0.273, 0.455], ["of", 0.455, 0.511], ["what", 0.511, 0.602], ["you", 0.602, 0.693], ["pay", 0.693, 0.909], ["above", 0.909, 1.17], ["face", 1.17, 1.432], ["value", 1.432, 1.727], ["goes", 1.739, 2.011], ["to", 2.023, 2.114], ["platforms", 2.114, 2.807], ["and", 2.807, 2.909], ["resellers", 2.92, 3.614], ["not", 3.966, 4.125], ["the", 4.125, 4.216], ["artist", 4.216, 4.693]]}, {"text": "New rules in the U.S. now require the full price to be shown up front.", "start": 57.912, "end": 62.088, "spec": null, "words": [["New", 0.091, 0.307], ["rules", 0.307, 0.636], ["in", 0.636, 0.693], ["the", 0.693, 0.727], ["U.S.", 0.727, 1.261], ["now", 1.386, 1.795], ["require", 1.989, 2.341], ["the", 2.341, 2.409], ["full", 2.409, 2.716], ["price", 2.727, 3.068], ["to", 3.068, 3.136], ["be", 3.136, 3.216], ["shown", 3.216, 3.432], ["up", 3.432, 3.5], ["front", 3.5, 3.841]]}, {"text": "Would you rather pay more up front, or fight the bots at exactly ten o'clock?", "start": 62.338, "end": 66.394, "spec": null, "words": [["Would", 0.091, 0.182], ["you", 0.182, 0.261], ["rather", 0.273, 0.489], ["pay", 0.489, 0.659], ["more", 0.67, 0.909], ["up", 0.92, 1.023], ["front", 1.023, 1.341], ["or", 1.739, 1.886], ["fight", 2.034, 2.307], ["the", 2.307, 2.386], ["bots", 2.386, 2.648], ["at", 2.648, 2.693], ["exactly", 2.693, 3.17], ["ten", 3.17, 3.295], ["o'clock", 3.295, 3.716]]}], "dur": 68.19}